  "description": "Stocks are going nowhere right now. Should I focus more on U.S. - Iran war analysis while we wait for better trades?",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and Happy Thursday!</p><p>As many of you know, we have been largely sitting out of the market for more than a month now. We do not throw money at assets when they are not working for us. If you missed any of these latest market related posts, they are linked below for your convenience. </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/a-silver-trade-setup-is-forming-again?r=4z8lgl\">Silver Trade I am Preparing For</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-226445041?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">CF Industries is Better Than Oil</a> – Up 7% Since Post</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-226384981?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Latest General Market Update</a> – S&amp;P 500, Oil, Gold, Silver, Bitcoin, Bonds and current views on the market with my strategy going forward. I will post these notes once a day until the market becomes more favorable, then switch back to full articles. Right now it is a waste of yours, and my, time to do long winded posts, for assets going down. </p></li></ul><p>The real purpose of this article, is to ask: <strong>What do you want?</strong></p><p>You may have seen some of my U.S. - Iran war commentary on TikTok or here on Substack. I am leveraging my background on these videos. If you do not know me, before becoming an investor, in short my career was:</p><p>U.S. Naval Academy (Economics) → Naval Officer (specialized in Anti-Terrorism, Mine warfare and was a “Top Gun” for Anti-Submarine Warfare) → Pentagon Analyst → General Dynamics Research &amp; Development → Huntington Ingalls Project Manager</p><p>I hated the military industrial complex so much, I withdrew my entire 401k of more than a decade+, managed it myself and went all in on stocks &amp; crypto back in 2019. That gamble paid off in 2021. That’s a story for another day. </p><p>Many of you came to my Substack, for the investing commentary. So I have contemplated ONLY doing investing content here… and leaving the “war” content for TikTok. Some of you may just want to tune out the world (I get it). But I have no idea whether you all want my insight or not. </p><h4>Please tell me in the comments, by selecting a #, of which you prefer:</h4><ol><li><p><strong>Only do investing content here on Substack</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Continue doing a mixture of war content and investing here on Substack </strong></p></li><li><p>Something else. Please explain in your comment. </p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/quick-question-for-stocktok-readers/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/quick-question-for-stocktok-readers/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p></li></ol><p>My goal is to make this the THE BEST finance Substack page. My intentions are to make money when we can, protect money when we have to. “War” content is secondary. Unfortunately, there are times we just have to sit on the sideline and watch the market eat people. That time is now. But I can’t read your minds and need feedback, to continue making this a place you want to visit regularly. </p><p>As always, questions are welcome in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/5586cfc3-d2a3-4585-9236-8e5c917eade7\">Main Chat</a> during market hours. This is where I hang out most of the time. And thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
